# range(r) subseteq A. ELIMINATED during normalization by the published
# construction, never by a completion rule (the rejected CR8).
# NOTE ELK has historically not supported ranges -- route this to a
# capability-probed complete oracle (SPEC 10 item 1).

@prefix :    <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:r a owl:ObjectProperty . :A a owl:Class . :B a owl:Class .
:r rdfs:range :A .
:B rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :r ; owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ] .
